  "review": {
    "gallery": "Two developer construction photographs from October 2026 and nine Ellington brochure renders. The landscape construction view leads the card and gallery. The current developer brochure link returns 404. The broker-hosted original was inspected.",
    "location": "The aerial project map and fifteen launch estimates are original Ellington materials hosted by Mitchell’s. The pin is from the broker page. AE7 lists the Meydan One Mall development as under construction.",
    "floorPlans": "Forty-seven complete original drawings: twenty-nine residential layouts, thirteen floor plates and five amenity drawings. The printed 4 BR Type C total is 3,026.2 sq ft while printed components 2,439.96 and 281.1 sum to 2,721.06 sq ft. Other sheets have small rounding differences. The drawings and printed totals remain available with a qualification."
  },
